<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 30 堂 · 學生版講義</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">對稱</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">軸對稱 · 鏡像 · 對稱軸可以係斜嘅 · 65 分鐘</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>對應教材：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下D冊 單元一<br/>
<b>核心陷阱：</b>🪤 <b>對稱軸一定係垂直線？錯！對稱軸可以係斜嘅！</b><br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 呈分試幾何題基礎，P5-P6常出對稱圖形辨識<br/>
<b>前置知識：</b>P3 基本圖形認識 · 鏡像概念 · 正方形/長方形特性<br/>
<b>本堂目標：</b>❶ 認識軸對稱 ❷ 找出對稱軸 ❸ 完成對稱圖形 ❹ 分辨對稱軸方向
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>學生姓名：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>班級：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>日期：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>完成時長：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題，5 分鐘）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 1</td><td>照鏡時，你舉起左手，鏡入面嘅你會舉起邊隻手？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:38px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 2</td><td>以下邊啲英文字母有對稱軸？A · B · C · D · E · M · T</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 3</td><td>正方形有幾多條對稱軸？畫出嚟。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 4</td><td>長方形有幾多條對稱軸？（提示：唔係4條！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 5</td><td>等邊三角形有幾多條對稱軸？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘） ＋ 例題練習</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：什麼是軸對稱？ <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>軸對稱：</b>一個圖形沿一條直線對摺後，兩邊<b>完全重疊</b><br/>
      ② <b>對稱軸 = 摺線：</b>對稱軸係一條想像中的線，圖形沿呢條線對摺後兩邊一模一樣<br/>
      ③ <b>鏡像效果：</b>對稱軸兩邊係對方的鏡像。距離對稱軸相同距離的點會對應<br/>
      ④ <b>重點：</b>對稱軸可以係垂直、水平、或<b>斜向</b>（45度都得！）
    </div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;">
<svg height="170" viewbox="0 0 500 170" width="500">
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="250" y="16">對稱軸的各種方向</text>
<!-- Vertical symmetry -->
<rect fill="#F0F9FF" height="125" rx="4" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" width="130" x="30" y="30"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="95" x2="95" y1="30" y2="155"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="95" y="170">垂直對稱軸</text>
<!-- Arrow shape -->
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="55,70 95,45 135,70 95,115" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon>
<!-- Horizontal symmetry -->
<rect fill="#F0FDF4" height="125" rx="4" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" width="130" x="185" y="30"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="185" x2="315" y1="92" y2="92"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="250" y="170">水平對稱軸</text>
<ellipse cx="250" cy="92" fill="#DCFCE7" rx="45" ry="30" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="1.5"></ellipse>
<!-- Diagonal symmetry -->
<rect fill="#FFFBEB" height="125" rx="4" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" width="130" x="340" y="30"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="350" x2="460" y1="40" y2="145"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="405" y="170">斜向對稱軸</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：常見圖形的對稱軸數量 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>正方形：4 條</b>（垂直+水平+兩條對角線）<br/>
      ② <b>長方形：2 條</b>（垂直+水平）⚠️ 對角線唔係對稱軸！<br/>
      ③ <b>等邊三角形：3 條</b>（每條從頂點到對邊中點）<br/>
      ④ <b>等腰三角形：1 條</b>（從頂點到底邊中點）<br/>
      ⑤ <b>圓形：無限多條</b>（任何穿過圓心的直線都係對稱軸）<br/>
      ⑥ <b>平行四邊形（非菱形）：0 條！</b>
</div>
</div>
<div class="fig-row">
<div class="fig-card">
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 140 130" width="140">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="90" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="90" x="25" y="20"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="70" x2="70" y1="20" y2="110"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="25" x2="115" y1="65" y2="65"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="25" x2="115" y1="20" y2="110"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="115" x2="25" y1="20" y2="110"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="125">正方形：4條</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="fig-card">
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 140 130" width="140">
<rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="70" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2.5" width="100" x="20" y="25"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="70" x2="70" y1="25" y2="95"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="20" x2="120" y1="60" y2="60"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="110">長方形：2條</text>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="123">對角線唔係！</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="fig-card">
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 140 130" width="140">
<polygon fill="#FEF3C7" points="70,20 20,100 120,100" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2.5"></polygon>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="70" x2="70" y1="20" y2="100"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="120">等腰三角形：1條</text>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命陷阱：長方形嘅對角線唔係對稱軸！沿對角線對摺，兩邊唔會完全重疊（因為長同闊唔同）。</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：完成對稱圖形 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>Step 1：</b>在方格紙上，找出對稱軸的位置<br/>
      ② <b>Step 2：</b>原有圖形的每個頂點，量度它到對稱軸的<b>垂直距離</b><br/>
      ③ <b>Step 3：</b>在對稱軸的另一邊，相同距離處標出對應點<br/>
      ④ <b>Step 4：</b>連接所有對應點，完成鏡像<br/>
      ⑤ <b>要訣：</b>數格！對稱軸左邊2格 → 右邊2格。對稱軸上邊3格 → 下邊3格
    </div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;">
<svg height="180" viewbox="0 0 320 180" width="320">
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="160" y="16">在方格紙上完成對稱圖形（對稱軸 = 紅色虛線）</text>
<!-- Grid -->
<rect fill="#FFF" height="130" stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.5" width="260" x="30" y="28"></rect>
<!-- Grid lines -->
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="30" x2="30" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="56" x2="56" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="82" x2="82" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="108" x2="108" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="134" x2="134" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="160" x2="160" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="186" x2="186" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="212" x2="212" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="238" x2="238" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="264" x2="264" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="290" x2="290" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<!-- Symmetry axis -->
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2.5" x1="160" x2="160" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<!-- Half shape on left -->
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="82,54 82,132 134,132 134,80 108,54" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Symmetric half on right (lighter) -->
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" fill-opacity="0.4" points="238,54 186,54 186,80 160,80 160,132 186,132 238,132" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-dasharray="3,2" stroke-width="1"></polygon>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="160" y="175">左邊=原有·右邊=對稱（虛線=學生要畫）</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">在方格紙上，畫出以紅色虛線為對稱軸的對稱圖形。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">以下哪條線是圖形的對稱軸？（給出選項，圖形=等腰三角形）</div></div>
<div class="lf-game">
<div class="gtitle">🎮 遊戲：對稱摺紙王</div>
<div class="grule">每人攞張紙，對摺後剪一個形狀。打開！睇邊個嘅對稱圖形最靚！</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一至三 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 6</td><td>寫出以下圖形各有幾多條對稱軸：(a)正方形 (b)長方形 (c)圓形</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 7</td><td>等腰三角形有1條對稱軸，呢條軸由邊度到邊度？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 8</td><td>在方格紙上，以垂直虛線為對稱軸，畫出一個三角形的對稱圖形。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:62px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、課堂分層同步練習 （20 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 基礎層（全體必做，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
